-end=\"819\">D\u00e9lka:<\/strong> 30 minut + Q&amp;A<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"890\"><strong>Online:<\/strong> odkaz v\u00e1m bude zasl\u00e1n po registraci<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"909\">Co se dozv\u00edte<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"983\">Pro\u010d m\u00e1 konven\u010dn\u00ed Ramanova spektroskopie v HTS aplikac\u00edch sv\u00e1 omezen\u00ed<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1062\">Jak <strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1010\">timegated Raman<\/strong> potla\u010duje fluorescenci a zvy\u0161uje citlivost m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1121\">Jak v praxi funguje <strong data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1119\">Timegate Microplate HTS syst\u00e9m<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1216\">Typick\u00e9 aplika\u010dn\u00ed p\u0159\u00edklady z oblasti bioproces\u016f, speci\u00e1ln\u00edch polymer\u016f a akademick\u00e9ho v\u00fdzkumu<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1361\">Webin\u00e1\u0159 je ur\u010den v\u0161em, kte\u0159\u00ed hledaj\u00ed robustn\u00ed a automatizovateln\u00e9 analytick\u00e9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed pro high-throughput screening bez kompromis\u016f v kvalit\u011b dat.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1397\"><strong data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1381\">Registrovat na webin\u00e1\u0159 se m\u016f\u017eete <a href=\"https:\/\/221yf.share.hsforms.com\/20rGMpPnhTce6v_UOb2LuGQ?utm_campaign=MicroPlate%20HTS%20System&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;_hsenc=p2ANqtz-9AFxviMZMslqwR1HhA4F-zGrq6wAGwwiMruPEK8_vMJZAEZoCzpC-07BYWiWY74LZB6AmvKBbIZWIGrOltYm1ykos_vQ&amp;_hsmi=397653276&amp;utm_content=397653276&amp;utm_source=hs_email\">zde<\/a>.<\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>High-throughput screening (HTS) klade na analytick\u00e9 metody mimo\u0159\u00e1dn\u00e9 n\u00e1roky. Siln\u00e9 fluorescen\u010dn\u00ed pozad\u00ed, riziko kontaminace vzork\u016f i omezen\u00e1 kompatibilita s automatizovan\u00fdm